    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Singularity fractured the world. Now, survivors rebuild among its ruins while machines and twisted mutants battle to shape what's left.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Singularity Divide</i> is a post-apocalyptic RTS where you're more than just a commander, you're the last thread holding humanity together. Build from scavenged ruins. Manage  survivors with unique stats. And decide who you\u2019ll trust: the evolving AI networks offering stability\u2026 or the mutated remnants whispering rebirth. Or will you forge a new path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base building from the bones of the old world</strong> \u2014 convert ruins into greenhouses, watchtowers, and survivor havens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong> \u2014 your decisions shape your tech tree, units, and narrative path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent AI &amp; Mutant threats</strong> \u2014 the more you grow, the more they notice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural world generation</strong> \u2014 every run brings new ruins, new layouts, and new dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat, strategy, and survival</strong> \u2014 it's not just about winning. It's about <i>what you're becoming</i> to do it.</p></li></ul>",
